      "created_at": "2026-10-06T08:27:45Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-10-06T08:27:45Z",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "Concept ACK, but make this configurable somehow.\r\n\r\nLike somebody said \"there is no one size fits all\" and from [above](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36398#issuecomment-5936779475) - rebroadcasting by the recipient has some positive sides.\r\n\r\nIn such cases I think it is best if we let the users decide what is best for them - give them the tools to configure it according to their environment and priorities.\r\n\r\nIf you decide to make this configurable, one possibility would be to extend `-walletbroadcast=<0|1>` with a new value, similarly to https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36380.",
